msgctxt "224"
msgid "Ngh... Who the hell are you...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid "What the hell were you trying to prove here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "248"
msgid "I was just practicing. I've gotta train my eyesight."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "260"
msgid "Your eyesight? What for?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "272"
msgid "You know about the Underground Coliseum?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr "Sì."

msgctxt "296"
msgid ""
"I compete in tournaments there. On days when I don't have a\r\n"
"fight, I go to different places to train myself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "308"
msgid ""
"That doesn't give you the right to cause issues for the poor\r\n"
"employees here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "320"
msgid "You're right. I won't do it anymore..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "332"
msgid "Oh, yeah!"
msgstr "Oh, sì!"

msgctxt "344"
msgid "What now?"
msgstr "Che c'è?"

msgctxt "356"
msgid "Fight with me at the Underground Coliseum!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "368"
msgid "Where'd this come from?"
msgstr "Da dove viene questa domanda?"

msgctxt "380"
msgid "Tag Matches! Join the Tag Match Grand Prix with me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "392"
msgid "Give me a break."
msgstr "Ma fammi il piacere."

msgctxt "404"
msgid ""
"No! I'm being serious! A guy like me and someone as strong\r\n"
"as you would make a winning team for sure!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "416"
msgid ""
"How about it? I guarantee you won't regret it! We good?\r\n"
"Good! It's a done deal!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "428"
msgid "Hey, wait a minute!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "440"
msgid "I'm Masayuki Hatae. What's your name?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "452"
msgid "Uh, Kazuma Kiryu."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "464"
msgid "Kiryu-san! Great meeting you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "476"
msgid ""
"I'll head on to the Underground Coliseum now! You can\r\n"
"come by whenever you want! I'll be waiting there for you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "536"
msgid "(Whew. Can he be any more hyper?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "560"
msgid "What's going on?"
msgstr "Cosa succede?"

msgctxt "572"
msgid ""
"That guy's not even using a bat... He's just trying to\r\n"
"dodge the balls..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "584"
msgid ""
"I'm trying to tell him to stop before he gets himself hurt,\r\n"
"but he won't listen to me. Why on Earth is he doing that...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "596"
msgid "Sir! Please, you're going to hurt yourself!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "608"
msgid "Shut it! I'm trying to concentrate! Don't distract me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "620"
msgid ""
"Ugh... See? He just won't listen to me. Do you think\r\n"
"you could convince him?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "632"
msgid "(I suppose I could, but...)"
msgstr "(Suppongo potrei, ma...)"

msgctxt "644"
msgid "Please. Would you talk to him for me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "656"
msgid "(I suppose I could, but...)"
msgstr "(Suppongo potrei, ma...)"

msgctxt "668"
msgid "(It's really none of my business...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "680"
msgid ""
"(This place has always been good to me. I should return the\r\n"
"favor by helping out.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "692"
msgid ""
"Hey, man, how about you give it a rest? You're causing\r\n"
"a disturbance."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "704"
msgid "The fuck!? Who the hell are you, anyway!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "776"
msgid ""
"At least he finally came out. The hell were you doing in\r\n"
"there?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "788"
msgid ""
"None of your business, buddy! I paid to use the cage, so\r\n"
"what does it matter how I use it!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "800"
msgid ""
"Your money or not, you're causing a disturbance, and if you\r\n"
"get hurt in there, you'll only make more trouble for these\r\n"
"poor employees."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "812"
msgid "What!? I ain't gonna get hurt!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "824"
msgid ""
"You will if one of those fastballs connects with your skull.\r\n"
"Give it a rest before you get knocked senseless."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "836"
msgid "Hmph... Got quite a mouth on you, don'tcha!?"
msgstr ""

